OL,3,GNEWSADriver taken to hospital after car
OL,4,Acrashes into wall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver has been taken to hospital
OL,7,Fafter a car crashed through a front
OL,8,Fgarden wall and into a parked vehicle
OL,9,Fin Leicester.
OL,11,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,Fsaid it was called to the crash in
OL,13,FGlenfield Road, near the junction with
OL,14,FWoodville Road, by police at 14:25 GMT
OL,15,Fon Sunday.
OL,17,FA spokesperson for Leicestershire
OL,18,FPolice said the driver was not
OL,19,Fseriously injured.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
