OL,3,GNEWSADriver taken to hospital after car
OL,4,Acrashes into wall
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere were concerns there could be a
OL,7,Fgas leak but distribution company
OL,8,FCadent was sent to inspect and no leak
OL,9,Fwas found. Firefighters left the scene
OL,10,Fat about 15:30.
